==English==

===Etymology===
{{L.}} ''[[horrificus]]''; ''[[horrere]]'' to be horrible + ''[[-ficare]]'' (in comp.) to make: confer {{F.}} ''[[horrifique]]''.  See [[horror]], [[-fy]].

===Pronunciation===
*Rhymes: [[Rhymes:English:-ɪfɪk|-ɪfɪk]]

===Adjective===
'''horrific'''
# [[horrifying]], causing [[horror]]; [[horrible]].

